Palm's Web app (com.palm.app.browser), copied from /usr/palm/applications on the reference
TouchPad (webOS CE 3.1.0), where its search list already offers DuckDuckGo first.

Copyright Palm, Inc. / Hewlett-Packard. Never released under an open licence; distributed by
Lunacy as abandonware, like Mojo, the Prelude fonts and the TouchPad wallpapers: no owner has
asserted rights since webOS was discontinued.

The app is here exactly as it was packaged. It runs because Lunacy answers what it asks for:
enyo.WebView draws pages with Android's own WebView in place of webOS's BrowserAdapter plugin
(LunaRuntimes/enyo-1.0/CHANGES.md, 0005), db8 holds the browser's bookmark, history and
preference kinds as the device's /etc/palm did, and the application manager, universal search
and download manager answer its calls.
